{"questions":[{"id":"Q034","typeId":"相反數等式","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S04:p1","S06:p1","S11:p1","S12:p1","S18:p1"],"prompt":"求使等式 (7*x-13)+(-4*x-8)=0 成立的 x。","answer":"7","explanation":"合併同類項並移項，得 x＝7；代入原式左右相等。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"(7*x-13)+(-4*x-8)=0","root":"7","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"-5/3","misconception":"合併常數時錯改第一括號−13的符號。"},{"id":"c2","text":"7"},{"id":"c3","text":"5/3","misconception":"把第二括號內的常數−8誤當成+8。"},{"id":"c4","text":"21/11","misconception":"忽略第二括號內−4x的負號。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q035","typeId":"相反數等式","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S04:p1","S06:p1","S11:p1","S12:p1","S18:p1"],"prompt":"求使等式 (-31+4*x)+(87-6*x)=0 成立的 x。","answer":"28","explanation":"合併同類項並移項，得 x＝28；代入原式左右相等。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"(-31+4*x)+(87-6*x)=0","root":"28","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"59/5","misconception":"把兩括號相加誤當成相減。"},{"id":"c2","text":"-28/5","misconception":"把−6x誤寫成+6x，錯誤相加未知數係數。"},{"id":"c3","text":"28"},{"id":"c4","text":"-59","misconception":"合併常數時把+87當成−87。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q036","typeId":"相反數等式","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S04:p1","S06:p1","S11:p1","S12:p1","S18:p1"],"prompt":"求使等式 (-14+x)+(39+x)=0 成立的 x。","answer":"-25/2","explanation":"合併同類項並移項，得 x＝-25/2；代入原式左右相等。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"(-14+x)+(39+x)=0","root":"-25/2","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"-25","misconception":"合併同類項後漏除未知數係數2。"},{"id":"c2","text":"-53/2","misconception":"把常數−14與39相加誤算成兩者絕對值和53。"},{"id":"c3","text":"25/2","misconception":"將2x＝−25除以2時遺漏負號。"},{"id":"c4","text":"-25/2"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q042","typeId":"同類項化簡","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p1","S02:p4"],"prompt":"去括號並化簡 3(−4t+5)−2(3t−7)。","answer":"-18t+29","explanation":"−12t+15−6t+14＝−18t+29。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"-18t+19","misconception":"第一括號常數5漏乘3，誤得5+14＝19。"},{"id":"c2","text":"-18t+29"},{"id":"c3","text":"-18t+1","misconception":"分配−2時，將−2乘−7誤算為−14。"},{"id":"c4","text":"-6t+1","misconception":"將減去2(3t−7)誤作加上2(3t−7)。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q045","typeId":"代入求值","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S05:p1"],"prompt":"資料表中，輸入 t＝5 時輸出為 −3t+8；另一欄輸出為−16。求另一欄的輸入 t。","answer":"8","explanation":"−3t+8＝−16，故t＝8。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"8"},{"id":"c2","text":"8/3","misconception":"把右側−16減8錯算成−16加8，誤得−3t＝−8。"},{"id":"c3","text":"-8","misconception":"由−3t＝−24除係數時遺漏負負得正。"},{"id":"c4","text":"5","misconception":"直接使用題目另一筆資料的輸入5，未解輸出−16那一欄。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q051","typeId":"等量公理","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S06:p1"],"prompt":"僅知au＝bu，關於是否能斷言a＝b，下列哪個判斷與理由正確？","answer":"不能","explanation":"u可能為0；例如a＝2、b＝9、u＝0。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"能，兩邊除以u即可，不需限制u。","misconception":"除以未知數前必須確定非0，否則會排除有效情形。"},{"id":"c2","text":"能，因為等式中的u必定等於1。","misconception":"擅自加入u＝1的條件；原題並未限制u。"},{"id":"c3","text":"不能；u＝0時a、b可以不同，等式仍成立。"},{"id":"c4","text":"不能，即使u≠0也不能把兩邊的u消去。","misconception":"對非0的相同因數，可以在等式兩側同除。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q053","typeId":"錯誤步驟診斷","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S06:p1"],"prompt":"解 3x−4＝2/7 時，有人寫①3x＝2/7+4；②21x＝2+4；③x＝2/7。最早錯在第幾步？","answer":"2","explanation":"②右邊的4也須乘7，應為21x＝2+28。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"第②步"},{"id":"c2","text":"第①步","misconception":"3x−4移項成3x＝2/7+4是正確的等量變形。"},{"id":"c3","text":"每一步都正確","misconception":"乘7去分母時，常數4也應乘7，不能保留為4。"},{"id":"c4","text":"第③步","misconception":"只追查最後一步，沒有發現第②步已漏把4乘7。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q054","typeId":"等價方程式","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p4","S03:p1","S06:p1"],"prompt":"將0.4x+1.7＝0.2x−0.9的兩邊同乘10，下列哪個等式正確？","answer":"4x+17=2x-9","explanation":"每一項都乘10。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"4x+1.7＝2x−0.9","misconception":"只將未知數項乘10，沒有將兩個常數同乘。"},{"id":"c2","text":"4x+17＝2x−9"},{"id":"c3","text":"4x+17＝0.2x−0.9","misconception":"只把等式左側乘10，右側沒有同步變動。"},{"id":"c4","text":"4x+17＝2x+9","misconception":"乘以正數10不會將右側−0.9的負號消掉。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q055","typeId":"參數代入","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S04:p1","S04:p2","S05:p4","S06:p2","S08:p1"],"prompt":"已知 x＝−2 使 5k−3x＝21 成立，求 k。","answer":"3","explanation":"5k+6＝21，得k＝3。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"27/5","misconception":"代入−2時把−3×(−2)誤當−6。"},{"id":"c2","text":"15","misconception":"移項得5k＝15後，漏除係數5。"},{"id":"c3","text":"3"},{"id":"c4","text":"21/5","misconception":"直接用21除以5，忽略代入後仍有常數6。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q057","typeId":"同解求參數","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S04:p1","S05:p3","S06:p2"],"prompt":"4x−9＝11 與 kx−6＝k+10 同解，求 k。","answer":"4","explanation":"第一式x＝5，代入第二式得5k−6＝k+10。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"4"},{"id":"c2","text":"5","misconception":"把第一個方程式的x值誤當成參數k。"},{"id":"c3","text":"2/3","misconception":"將右側kx與常數移項時，錯用係數和與常數差。"},{"id":"c4","text":"16/5","misconception":"代入x＝5後漏掉右側k，誤列5k＝16。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q060","typeId":"整式求值","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S04:p1","S04:p2","S08:p1"],"prompt":"已知2−17x＝53，不先求x，求80+51x。","answer":"-73","explanation":"17x＝−51，故51x＝−153，80−153＝−73。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"233","misconception":"將17x＝−51誤算成17x＝51，造成51x符號錯誤。"},{"id":"c2","text":"-3","misconception":"只算出未知數x，沒有代回所求80+51x。"},{"id":"c3","text":"29","misconception":"誤把51x直接當成17x，沒有使用三倍關係。"},{"id":"c4","text":"-73"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q061","typeId":"整式求值","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S04:p2"],"prompt":"若5(a+3)−2(a−4)＝17，求a²−a+2。","answer":"8","explanation":"3a+23＝17，a＝−2，代入得4+2+2＝8。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"8"},{"id":"c2","text":"0","misconception":"將(−2)²誤算為−4，忽略平方後應為正數。"},{"id":"c3","text":"4","misconception":"只計算a²，漏掉後面的−a+2。"},{"id":"c4","text":"6","misconception":"計算a²−a後，漏加最後的常數2。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"}]}